# Architecture rules

- Until stack is chosen, do not scaffold conflicting frameworks; record choice in `docs/architecture/ADR/002-tech-stack.md` first.
- Design as **web client + API** boundaries so iOS can reuse the API later (even if initially a modular monolith).
- Timezone default for providers: `Europe/Istanbul` unless overridden.
- Booking integrity: prevent double-booking at the data layer (unique constraints / transactional checks).
- i18n: no hardcoded user-facing strings in components once the app exists — use message catalogs (EN + TR).
- Document structural decisions as ADRs under `docs/architecture/ADR/`.
